        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          A good surge protector absorbs voltage spikes before they reach your TV, computer and chargers. This guide explains joule ratings, clamping voltage, UL 1449 and the indicator lights, then ranks seven real surge protector strips and tells you when to replace yours.
